{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>吳若希在全新處境劇《愛·回家之三代同糖》擔正女主角，卻因劇情安排被遠派非洲「吳旺達」而暫別劇組。坊間盛傳她因收 …</p><p></p>\n<p>吳若希在全新處境劇《愛·回家之三代同糖》擔正女主角，卻因劇情安排被遠派非洲「吳旺達」而暫別劇組。坊間盛傳她因收視不佳被高層開刀祭旗，其實背後隱藏着更為嚴峻的危機。這位女一號的身體狀況早已經亮起令人震驚的紅燈。</p>\n<h2>吳若希長期日夜顛倒 傳收工返家突然暈倒</h2>\n<p>吳若希入行以來首次挑大樑接拍長篇處境大作，連續開工2個多月以來長期處於日夜顛倒狀態。極高壓拍攝環境令她體力嚴重透支，有傳她曾試過收工返家後突然眼前一黑暈倒，嚇得丈夫何兆鴻火速將她緊急送往醫院搶救。雖然經醫生詳細檢查後證實純屬嚴重疲勞過度所致，但這場虛驚已足以敲響警號，令她深感健康可貴，並主動向公司請大假暫別劇組調養身體，隨即帶同2名子女飛了2趟旅行充電。</p>\n<h2>吳若希親自澄清手震傳聞並否認入院</h2>\n<p>面對外界對於大病初癒及暈倒送院種種揣測，當事人終於挺身而出親自拆解謎團。吳若希接受傳媒查詢時堅決否認暈倒傳聞，並親口直言：「都冇身體唔好，不過我手震係真嘅，係要去check check係真嘅，但係冇暈低、冇送院。」即使她極力澄清未有入院，但親證確實受手震問題困擾兼需入院檢查，近日她豪擲逾15萬為剛滿6歲幼子何少弘舉辦豪華生日派對時，被現場人士發現她面色蒼白兼雙手微微發震。</p>\n<h2>吳若希被指拍劇無暇照顧子女 寧願退居客串</h2>\n<p>這次風波並非單純緣於一次過度勞累，而是長久以來事業與家庭拉扯下所引發。知情人士透露她私底下曾向閨密大吐苦水，坦言長劇女主角非人生活確實不適合自己，加上長時間被困劇組拍劇令她完全分身乏術，難以兼顧家中年幼子女起居飲食。幾經深思熟慮後決定未來寧願接拍時間較具彈性客串角色，才能在演藝事業與家庭生活之間取得平衡，目前她正積極處理美容院代言合約及拍攝新廣告。</p>\n<h2>吳若希突然離開《愛·回家》 網民反應兩極</h2>\n<p>劇情安排角色被流放遠方一事在網絡上持續發酵，大批觀眾對此感到震驚及惋惜。不少網民熱烈討論劇集走向，有人留言嘲諷此劇已經變成「三代徬徨」，更有人猜測劇中對白是否「句句有骨」暗寸當事人。另一邊廂亦有大量忠實粉絲大表心痛，紛紛留言叮囑偶像「健康最重要」及「快啲好番」，並支持她暫時放下沉重工作負擔好好休養生息。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179431850588875014_6274254336af320aa43c9b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"吳若希 愛回家之三代同糖 離開時，吳若希、李茵彤、車婉婉「三代同堂」催淚相擁。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179431850588875014_6274254336af320aa43c9b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>離開時，吳若希、李茵彤、車婉婉「三代同堂」催淚相擁。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179229702691712656_4264864506ad448432f5fe.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"吳若希 愛回家之三代同糖 吳若希已暫別劇組（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179229702691712656_4264864506ad448432f5fe.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>吳若希已暫別劇組（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179203478176023159_20400736856ad047de287df.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"吳若希 愛回家之三代同糖 （圖片來源：車婉婉IG）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179203478176023159_20400736856ad047de287df.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：車婉婉IG）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179293067511276129_3589774066addf3735c074.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"吳若希 愛回家之三代同糖 最多觀看次數一集竟然是吳若希被送走的（圖片來源：YouTube ）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179293067511276129_3589774066addf3735c074.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>最多觀看次數一集竟然是吳若希被送走的（圖片來源：YouTube ）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179300826910496172_15312637326adf228d7d95b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"吳若希 愛回家之三代同糖 踢走吳若希力捧何依婷，數據上睇都係不盡人意！（圖片來源：YouTube ）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179300826910496172_15312637326adf228d7d95b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>踢走吳若希力捧何依婷，數據上睇都係不盡人意！（圖片來源：YouTube ）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179431850738288973_11987166876af320ac0bb90.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"吳若希 愛回家之三代同糖 吳若希豪擲逾15萬為細仔何少弘辦生日會。（圖片來源：IG@jinnyngfamily）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179431850738288973_11987166876af320ac0bb90.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>吳若希豪擲逾15萬為細仔何少弘辦生日會。（圖片來源：IG@jinnyngfamily）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%90%b3%e8%8b%a5%e5%b8%8c/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">吳若希</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%84%9b%e5%9b%9e%e5%ae%b6%e4%b9%8b%e4%b8%89%e4%bb%a3%e5%90%8c%e7%b3%96/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">愛回家之三代同糖</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%99%95%e5%a2%83%e5%8a%87/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">處境劇</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：TVB、車婉婉IG、YouTube、IG@jinnyngfamily資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3539894\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 10 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T15:22:56.230619+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1477,"images":6,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T13:48:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T16:37:38.892663+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T15:16:01.566977+00:00","content_hash":"a8974a72dbda6b9a51182365e810f2463a6ebf7f3d4de8dd32c5638d70ee168b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}